  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, my father, he is Polish, his English is good but when he is nervous he goes to Polish, so I will start. He sees two of everything in the evenings. Dwoje, he says."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dwoje. Two. Double, double. In the evening, the television, two."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you both. Mr Kowalczyk, how long has this been happening?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two months. Since the, the autumn."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Papa, it is longer. It was before the wedding in June. That is four months at least."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Two to four months, then. Is it one eye or both?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When I close one eye, one picture. So both eyes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What else do you notice?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "His right eyelid, it droops by the end of the day. Like he is sleepy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My eyes are tired. Heavy, by evening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other muscles that get tired?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Chewing. A steak, I must stop and rest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "And his voice goes quiet at night, I can't hear him on the phone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Understood. Which tablets do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bisoprolol, 5 mg, in the morning. And a small white pill for the thyroid, I do not know the name, in Polish I know it, here no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can bring the box on Monday. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That would help. Any allergies, Mr Kowalczyk?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "In the hospital, a long time ago, some injection, I had a rash, I think. Which injection, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll note a possible allergy, unconfirmed. Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure. The thyroid, underactive. And cataracts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right eye, cataract, in 2019. And the hernia, 2011."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What did you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Electrician, forty years. Retired."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Who do you live with?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "With me, and my family, since mama died."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Blood pressure 138 over 80, pulse 62, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 14, weight 79 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is the pulse low? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's on the slow side because of the bisoprolol. Now, Mr Kowalczyk, look up at my finger and keep looking, don't look away.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Up. Up. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "After about a minute, the right upper eyelid droops."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Yes! That is it! ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And when I ask you to look to the side, you start with one picture, then a second one appears after a while."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, it comes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Here is my thinking. Droopy eyelid, double vision and weakness that all get worse with tiredness is a pattern I take seriously. I can't rule out a condition where nerves and muscles don't communicate properly, called myasthenia."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is it serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's treatable, but I'd like to be careful. I'd like to arrange a blood test for the antibodies linked to it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When do I know? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A week or so. I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Two weeks. I will bring him and the box. ~"
  }
